For a new email, `services/user.py` generates a 16-byte random salt, hashes the password with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 using 200,000 iterations, then calls [insert_user(...)](/Users/basethesis/Desktop/benchmark_hermes-fabric/experiment_rerun_20260530T080846Z/prereqs/fixtures/task02_signup_flow/db/repo.py:26) with:

